  <!-- Upgrade Kit Items -->
  <MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_A>Shuttle Upgrade Kit Lv.1</MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_A>
  <MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_A_desc>Shuttle interior space upgrade kit. Installs a 7x6 interior space for colonists to rest and store items.\n\nUse on a shuttle to install. One kit per shuttle.</MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_A_desc>
  
  <MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_B>Shuttle Upgrade Kit Lv.2</MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_B>
  <MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_B_desc>Shuttle interior space upgrade kit. Installs an 8x7 interior space for colonists to rest and store items.\n\nUse on a shuttle to install. One kit per shuttle.</MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_B_desc>
  
  <MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_C>Shuttle Upgrade Kit Lv.3</MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_C>
  <MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_C_desc>Shuttle interior space upgrade kit. Installs a 9x7 interior space for colonists to rest and store items.\n\nUse on a shuttle to install. One kit per shuttle.</MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_C_desc>
  
  <MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_D>Shuttle Upgrade Kit Lv.4</MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_D>
  <MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_D_desc>Shuttle interior space upgrade kit. Installs a 10x8 interior space for colonists to rest and store items.\n\nUse on a shuttle to install. One kit per shuttle.</MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_D_desc>
  
  <MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_E>Shuttle Upgrade Kit Lv.5</MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_E>
  <MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_E_desc>Shuttle interior space upgrade kit. Installs a 12x10 maximum interior space for colonists to rest and store items.\n\nUse on a shuttle to install. One kit per shuttle.</MaiyaAeroBay_UpgradeKit_E_desc>
  
