  <!-- Civilian Shuttle -->
  <MaiyaAeroBay_CivilianShuttle>Civilian Shuttle</MaiyaAeroBay_CivilianShuttle>
  <MaiyaAeroBay_CivilianShuttle_desc>A chemfuel-powered civilian shuttle designed for medium-distance travel. While not as capable as military shuttles, it is cheap to build and doesn't require rare shuttle engines.\n\nCan install upgrade kits for interior space (max Lv.2). Weapon and shield kits are unrestricted. Carries 200kg, max range ~30 tiles.</MaiyaAeroBay_CivilianShuttle_desc>

  <!-- Research Projects -->
  <MaiyaAeroBay_CivilianAviation_label>Civilian Aviation</MaiyaAeroBay_CivilianAviation_label>
  <MaiyaAeroBay_CivilianAviation_desc>Unlocks the ability to build civilian shuttles and shuttle upgrade kits. Civilian shuttles are low-cost medium-range transport that can install upgrade kits for interior space.</MaiyaAeroBay_CivilianAviation_desc>

  <!-- Weapon Kits -->
  <MaiyaAeroBay_WeaponKit_DualMG>Dual Machine Gun Kit</MaiyaAeroBay_WeaponKit_DualMG>
  <MaiyaAeroBay_WeaponKit_DualMG_desc>Shuttle weapon kit. Installs dual machine guns that automatically attack enemies in range. Damage 12x4, range 28 tiles.\n\nUse on a shuttle to install. One weapon kit per shuttle. Only effective when shuttle is on the ground.</MaiyaAeroBay_WeaponKit_DualMG_desc>
  
  <MaiyaAeroBay_WeaponKit_Autocannon>Autocannon Kit</MaiyaAeroBay_WeaponKit_Autocannon>
  <MaiyaAeroBay_WeaponKit_Autocannon_desc>Shuttle weapon kit. Installs a heavy autocannon that automatically attacks enemies in range. Damage 30, range 35 tiles.\n\nUse on a shuttle to install. One weapon kit per shuttle. Only effective when shuttle is on the ground.</MaiyaAeroBay_WeaponKit_Autocannon_desc>
  
  <MaiyaAeroBay_WeaponKit_Rocket>Rocket Pod Kit</MaiyaAeroBay_WeaponKit_Rocket>
  <MaiyaAeroBay_WeaponKit_Rocket_desc>Shuttle weapon kit. Installs a rocket pod that automatically attacks enemies in range. Damage 50x3, range 40 tiles.\n\nUse on a shuttle to install. One weapon kit per shuttle. Only effective when shuttle is on the ground.</MaiyaAeroBay_WeaponKit_Rocket_desc>
  
  <MaiyaAeroBay_WeaponKit_Laser>Laser Cannon Kit</MaiyaAeroBay_WeaponKit_Laser>
  <MaiyaAeroBay_WeaponKit_Laser_desc>Shuttle weapon kit. Installs a laser cannon that automatically attacks enemies in range. Damage 45 (armor-piercing), range 50 tiles.\n\nUse on a shuttle to install. One weapon kit per shuttle. Only effective when shuttle is on the ground.</MaiyaAeroBay_WeaponKit_Laser_desc>

  <!-- Shield Kits -->
  <MaiyaAeroBay_ShieldKit_Simple>Simple Shield Kit</MaiyaAeroBay_ShieldKit_Simple>
  <MaiyaAeroBay_ShieldKit_Simple_desc>Shuttle defense kit. Installs a permanent shield that can block incoming attacks. Shield HP 150, slow recharge. EMP attack disables shield for 10 seconds.\n\nUse on a shuttle to install. One shield kit per shuttle. Only effective when shuttle is on the ground.</MaiyaAeroBay_ShieldKit_Simple_desc>
  
  <MaiyaAeroBay_ShieldKit_Energy>Energy Shield Kit</MaiyaAeroBay_ShieldKit_Energy>
  <MaiyaAeroBay_ShieldKit_Energy_desc>Shuttle defense kit. Installs an energy shield that can block incoming attacks. Shield HP 300, medium recharge. EMP attack disables shield for 8 seconds.\n\nUse on a shuttle to install. One shield kit per shuttle. Only effective when shuttle is on the ground.</MaiyaAeroBay_ShieldKit_Energy_desc>
  
  <MaiyaAeroBay_ShieldKit_Reinforced>Reinforced Shield Kit</MaiyaAeroBay_ShieldKit_Reinforced>
  <MaiyaAeroBay_ShieldKit_Reinforced_desc>Shuttle defense kit. Installs a reinforced shield that can block incoming attacks. Shield HP 500, fast recharge. EMP attack disables shield for 5 seconds.\n\nUse on a shuttle to install. One shield kit per shuttle. Only effective when shuttle is on the ground.</MaiyaAeroBay_ShieldKit_Reinforced_desc>

